[198.487868, "o", "    \"text\": \"Ciao, come stai oggi?\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 8,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.9888\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"text\": \"Olá, como você está?\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 12,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.9896\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"text\": \"Привет, как дела?\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 13,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.9856\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"text\": \"こんにちは、お元気ですか？\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 9,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.9649\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"text\": \"你好，你好吗？\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 19,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.936\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"text\": \"مرحبا، كيف حالك؟\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 0,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.988\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"text\": \"Hello, how are you?\",\r\n    \"predicted_class_id\": 4,\r\n    \"confidence\": 0.9737\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\r\nPredicted class IDs are argmax of merged model logits with confidence = softmax max. The merged model is ready at `/app/merged_model/` and results are at `/app/detection_results.json`.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=glimmer-30b tools=25 surface"]
